ACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>) 16:00~17:00 (예정)<br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 본교 든사람교육센터</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">도서관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">211</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">호</span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">발표방법 : 각 동아리 대표자(또는 회원)가 제출한 활동계획서를 토대로 자유롭게 발표(5분~10분)</span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></span></span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">중간 평가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">9</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">中 </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">실시 예정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">추후 공지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span>&nbsp;&nbsp; 3</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)&nbsp;최종</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"> 평가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">中 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">실시 예정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">추후 공지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#2d629c\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"\"><strong>▣ </strong></font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><font face=\"\">지원기간</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;동아리 선정 완료 시 ~ 2014년 1월 (예산 소진 시, 조기마감 가능)</span></span><br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타사항<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 2013</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 취업동아리 운영지침이 일부 변경되었으므로 첨부된 운영지침 필히 확인 요망<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">변경사항 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">제출서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동비 차등 지급 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 2012</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 등록한 기존동아리는 재등록 신청을 하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">재등록 신청 방법은 상기 내용과 동일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 기타 자세한 사항은 취업지원본부 홈페이지-취업동아리-공지사항 참고<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">문의처 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업지원본부 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">☎</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">054-478-7983<br><br>붙임&nbsp; 취업동아리 신청 구비서류(양식)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
